  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) ̶ , +, ÷, ×, =, +**\n\n→ 52 - 12 + **15 ÷ 3** × 6 = 5 + 15\n\n→ 52 - 12 + **5 ×**** 6** = 5 + 15\n\n→ **52** - 12 **+ 30** = **5 +**** 15**\n\n→ 82 - 12 = 20\n\n→ 70 ≠ 20\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**2) -, +, ÷, =, ×, +**\n\n→ 52 - 12 + **15 ÷ 3** = 6 × 5 + 15\n\n→ 52 - 12 + 5 = **6 ****×**** 5** + 15\n\n→ **52** - 12 **+ 5** = **30 + 15**\n\n→ 57 - 12 = 45\n\n→ 45 = 45\n\n→ **LHS = RHS** ⇒ **Satisfies the equation**\n\n**3) ̶ , +, ×, =, ÷, +**\n\n→ 52 - 12 + 15 × 3 = **6 ÷ 5** + 15\n\n→ 52 - 12 + **15 ****×**** 3** = 6/5 + 15\n\n→ **52** - 12 **+ 45** = **6/5 + 15**\n\n→ 97 - 12 = 81/5\n\n→ 85 ≠ 81/5\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**4) +, ̶ , ÷, ×, =, +**\n\n→ 52 + 12 - **15 ÷ 3** × 6 = 5 + 15\n\n→ 52 + 12 - **5 ×**** 6** = 5 + 15\n\n→ **52 + 12** - 30 = **5 +**** 15**\n\n→ 64 - 30 = 20\n\n→ 34 ≠ 20\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\" -****, +, ÷, =, ×, +\"**.\n\n3",
